_A8 = [("Ang proporsiyon ng mga mambabatas na may mga kamag-anak sa mga elective positions ay nananatiling matatag at lalong dumadami simula noong post-Marcos political scene.", "The proportion of lawmakers with relatives in elective positions remains steady and keeps increasing since the post-Marcos political scene."), ("Batay sa pag-aaral ng mga political scientists, umabot na sa isandaan at animnapu’t siyam na mga prominenteng pamilya na kasapi sa tinatawag na mga elitistang pulitiko meron ang Pilipinas.", "Based on the study of political scientists, the Philippines already has one hundred sixty-nine prominent families that are members of the so-called elitist politicians."), ("Ang mga pamilyang ito ay nakabuo ng limandaan at walumpu’t apat na public officials kasali na rito ang pito na naging pangulo ng Pilipinas, dalawang bise-presidente, apatnapu’t dalawang senador, at isandaan at apatnapu’t pitong kongresista.", "These families produced five hundred eighty-four public officials, including seven who became president of the Philippines, two vice-presidents, forty-two senators, and one hundred forty-seven congressmen."), ("Noong Fourteenth Congress nakitang tumaas pa ito ng pitumpu’t limang porsyentong mga mambabatas na miyembro ng old political families.", "In the Fourteenth Congress it was seen to rise further to seventy-five percent of lawmakers who were members of old political families.")]
_NUM8 = [["1", "prominent families", "169"], ["2", "public officials", "584"], ["3", "presidents", "7"], ["4", "vice-presidents", "2"], ["5", "senators", "42"], ["6", "congressmen", "147"], ["7", "lawmakers in the 14th Congress from old political families", "75%"]]
_G8 = "During the post-Marcos political scene, the proportion of lawmakers with relatives in elective positions increased. Based on political scientists’ studies, the number has increased to prominent families with connections to elitists. These elitist families had 584 public officials. Included in this number are 7 who became presidents of the Philippines, 2 vice-presidents, 42 senators, and 140 congressmen. During the 14th Congress the numbers increased to 75% lawmakers who were members of old political families. The book’s key says 160 families and 140 congressmen and mentions 169 prominent families twice; the script says 169 and 147."
_A9 = [("Bahala na, isa sa mga ugali ng mga Pilipino na kapag may proyekto ay nagtatamaran lang at hindi aayusin ang nagawang proyekto at nagsasabi lang ng bahala na.", "Bahala na, one of the traits of Filipinos who, when there is a project, just feel lazy and will not fix the project done and just say bahala na."), ("Ningas kugon, sa una lang ito magaling o masigasig ngunit kalaunan ay hindi na naitutuloy ang nasimulan.", "Ningas kugon, at first it is good or diligent but eventually what was started is no longer continued."), ("Mapapansin ito sa mga simulang masigasig na pagpupursigi ng mga kaso ng katiwalian ngunit sa huli ay walang napaparusahan o nabibilanggo.", "This can be noticed in the diligent initial pursuit of corruption cases but in the end no one is punished or jailed."), ("Crab mentality, isang kaugalian ng mga Pilipino ng paninirang puri, paggawa ng kuwento sa kapwa at inggit sa mga nakakaangat na kababayan.", "Crab mentality, a Filipino habit of slander, making up stories about others, and envy of countrymen who rise above.")]
_A10 = [("Sinabi ni Kalihim Mar Roxas ng DILG na may mga konkretong hakbang na ginagawa ang PNP para malinis ang hanay nito mula sa bakas ng korupsyon, lalo na sa simula ng pagre-recruit ng mga bagong tauhan ng PNP.", "DILG Secretary Mar Roxas said that the PNP is taking concrete steps to clean its ranks of traces of corruption, especially at the start of recruiting new PNP personnel."), ("Sinabi niyang isang malaking hamon para sa DILG, PNP, at National Police Commission na harapin ang resulta ng survey na ginawa ng Transparency International kung saan lumalabas na ang tingin ng publiko sa kapulisan ay pinaka-corrupt na mga opisyales sa Pilipinas.", "He said it is a big challenge for the DILG, PNP, and National Police Commission to face the result of the survey by Transparency International, in which it appears that the public views the police as the most corrupt officials in the Philippines."), ("Sa scale na isa hanggang lima, binigyan ng mga respondents ng iskor na apat ang kapulisan sa pangkalahatan.", "On a scale of one to five, the respondents gave the police in general a score of four."), ("Sinabi ni Roxas na ang mga bagong aplikante sa pagpupulis mula sa iba’t-ibang rehiyon, pagkatapos makapasa sa lahat ng rekisitos at mga eksamin ay palagiang nahaharap sa korupsyon dahil kinakailangan nilang personal na maghanap ng pera o manghingi ng suporta mula sa mga padrinos upang makapasok sa kapulisan o sandatahang pulis.", "Roxas said that new applicants to the police from different regions, after passing all the requirements and exams, are always faced with corruption because they personally need to find money or ask for support from padrinos in order to get into the police force."), ("Papalitan natin ito, babaguhin natin ito. Lahat ng kwalipikado ngayon ipapasok yung pangalan nila sa isang tambyolo at pagpili ay pantay-pantay ang laban para sa lahat, hindi na kelangan padrino, kakilala. Hindi kelangan ng insider na tutulong, hindi kelangan na manuhol at sa ganun paraan ay makakapagsimula ang ating PO One sa kanilang career na hindi sila gumawa ng panunuhol sa pagiging pulis, ani niya.", "We will replace this, we will change this. All the qualified will now have their names put in a lottery drum and the choice will be an equal fight for everyone, there is no more need for a padrino or an acquaintance. There is no need for an insider to help, no need to bribe, and in this way our PO1s can begin their careers without bribing to become police, he said."), ("Dahil ano ang unang gagawin nyan eh di maghahanap ng ibang pagkakakitaan para mabawi yung sinuhol. So, ito sa utos ko sa Napolcom, i-finalize na yung implementing rules nito at sa darating na mga linggo ay implement na ito. So, ito ay isang malinaw at konkretong hakbang para yung ating mga pulis lalong lalo na yung recruits na PO One makakapag-simula ng pagiging pulis sa malinis na paraan, dagdag niya.", "Because what will that person do first but look for other income to recover what was paid as a bribe. So, this is my order to Napolcom, finalize the implementing rules and in the coming weeks implement it. So, this is a clear and concrete step so that our police, especially the PO1 recruits, can begin being police in a clean way, he added.")]
_K10 = [("1. The challenge faced by the DILG, PNP and National Police Commission", "The challenge for the three government agencies is how to change the negative perception of the public about the officials in the said agencies. This was the result of the survey conducted by Transparency International where, on the scale of one to five, the respondents scored the police agency as having the most corrupt officials in the country."), ("2. In what context the padrino system is used", "The padrino system is used in the context of recruiting police officers (PO1s). The police applicants in different regions, after passing the examination and completing all the requirements, are faced with corruption. The applicants need to find money or ask for support from padrinos to be able to join the police ranks."), ("3. What the DILG is doing to prevent corruption in the police force", "The DILG Secretary said that a big step is underway to change the recruitment of the new police force. He said that all the names of the qualified applicants will be placed in a lottery drum. In this manner, the selection will be fair for everyone. There is no need for a padrino or someone you know, or an insider. There is also no need to bribe. In this way, the new police recruits will not resort to bribing just to gain admission in the police force."), ("4. The DILG Secretary’s order to NAPOLCOM", "The instruction is to finalize the implementing rules and, in the coming weeks, this (policy) should be implemented.")]
