        card("Activity 9: the book’s key (any one)", "1. Bahala na: one of the Filipino traits wherein, when there is a project to do, they just feel lazy, will not fix the project, and will just say bahala na. 2. Ningas kugon: at the beginning, they are good and enthusiastic, but later they will not continue what they enthusiastically started. This can be observed in the initial intense pursuit of justice in corruption cases resulting in no one being punished or jailed. 3. Crab mentality: a Filipino trait involving character assassination, making up false stories about one’s countryman, and envy for those who are more fortunate."),
