_L11 = [("Mañana habit", "Ina", "Bingbing, may exam ka sa Lunes di ba. Sabado na ngayon, dapat nag-aaral ka. Hindi pa kita nakitang nag-review. Mamaya malalaman ko na lang na bagsak ka sa eksam.", "Bingbing, you have an exam on Monday, right. It is already Saturday, you should be studying. I have not seen you review. Later I will find out that you failed the exam."), ("Mañana habit", "Bingbing", "Nay naman, may Lunes pa e. May isang araw pa ako. Bukas na ako mag-aaral.", "Nay, there is still Monday. I still have one day. I will study tomorrow."), ("Mañana habit", "Ina", "Ay naku, hindi ka aasenso kapag ganyan ang ugali mo. Gawin mo ang puwedeng gawin ngayon. Hindi puro bukas.", "Oh my, you will not get ahead with that attitude. Do what can be done today. Not all tomorrow."), ("Colonial mentality", "Anak", "Nay, ang ganda naman ng sapatos niyo. Yan ba yung pinadala ni Kuya galing Amerika?", "Nay, your shoes are so beautiful. Are those the ones Kuya sent from America?"), ("Colonial mentality", "Nanay", "Hindi anak, Marikina shoes lang ito. Mura na matibay pa. At saka gawang Pilipinas.", "No, child, these are just Marikina shoes. Cheap and sturdy too. And made in the Philippines."), ("Colonial mentality", "Anak", "Ay naku, Nay, iba talaga ang imported kesa lokal. Pag imported kasi mas may kalidad at mukhang pangmayaman.", "Oh Nay, imported is really different from local. When it is imported, it has more quality and looks fit for the rich."), ("Political dynasty", "Nanay", "Anak, sino ang kandidato mo ngayong halalan?", "Child, who is your candidate in this election?"), ("Political dynasty", "Anak", "Siyempre po yung anak ng dating Mayor. Yung pong apo ni Senador Pantaleon.", "Of course the child of the former Mayor. The grandchild of Senator Pantaleon."), ("Political dynasty", "Nanay", "Naku, anak sila-sila na lang palagi. Dapat iba naman. Marami namang ibang magaling na hindi magkakamag-anak.", "Goodness, child, it is always just them. It should be someone else. There are many other capable people who are not related."), ("Palakasan system", "Tiya", "O, kumusta ang pag-aaplay mo sa trabaho? Natanggap ka ba?", "Well, how is your job application? Were you accepted?"), ("Palakasan system", "Pamangkin", "Hindi po ako natanggap. Yung anak ni Barangay Kapitan ang pinili nila.", "I was not accepted. They chose the Barangay Captain’s child."), ("Palakasan system", "Tiya", "Hindi ba mas qualified ka naman dun?", "Aren’t you more qualified than that person?"), ("Palakasan system", "Pamangkin", "Tita naman, alam nyo naman kung sinong may kakilala e siya yung matatanggap. Susubukan ko na lang po sa ibang kumpanya.", "Tita, you know it is whoever has an acquaintance who gets accepted. I will just try another company."), ("Palakasan system", "Tiya", "Kung ganun, hihingi ako ng rekomendasyon kay Mayor. Kumpare ko ’yun sa kasal ni Zenaida. Susubukan ko. Wag kang mag-alala.", "In that case, I will ask Mayor for a recommendation. He is my co-sponsor at Zenaida’s wedding. I will try. Do not worry.")]
